                    "cotester_chat_messages": [
                        {
                            "id": "39",
                            "tc_id": "108",
                            "thread_id": "",
                            "user_id": "1",
                            "message": "facebook login testcase give me",
                            "message_type": "sender",
                            "created_at": "2026-07-06 21:11:54",
                            "updated_at": "2026-07-06 21:11:54"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "40",
                            "tc_id": "108",
                            "thread_id": "",
                            "user_id": "1",
                            "message": "Test Case: 1\n\nTest Case Title: Successful Login with Valid Credentials\nModule: Login\nPriority: High\n\nPreconditions:\n- User has a registered Facebook account.\n- User is on the Facebook login page.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Enter a valid email address or phone number in the Username field.\n2. Enter the correct password in the Password field.\n3. Click the Log In button.\n\nExpected Result:\n- User is redirected to the Facebook homepage.\n- User’s news feed and profile are displayed correctly.\n- No error messages are shown.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 2\n\nTest Case Title: Login Attempt with Invalid Password\nModule: Login\nPriority: High\n\nPreconditions:\n- User has a registered Facebook account.\n- User is on the Facebook login page.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Enter a valid email address or phone number in the Username field.\n2. Enter an incorrect password in the Password field.\n3. Click the Log In button.\n\nExpected Result:\n- User remains on the login page.\n- An error message is displayed stating \"The password that you've entered is incorrect.\"\n- User is prompted to try again or use the \"Forgotten password?\" link.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 3\n\nTest Case Title: Login Attempt with Unregistered Email or Phone Number\nModule: Login\nPriority: Medium\n\nPreconditions:\n- User is on the Facebook login page.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Enter an unregistered email address or phone number in the Username field.\n2. Enter any password in the Password field.\n3. Click the Log In button.\n\nExpected Result:\n- User remains on the login page.\n- An error message is displayed stating that no account was found with the entered credentials.\n- User is prompted to sign up for a new account or try again.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 4\n\nTest Case Title: Password Recovery Navigation\nModule: Login\nPriority: Medium\n\nPreconditions:\n- User is on the Facebook login page.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Click the \"Forgotten password?\" link.\n2. Enter a valid email address or phone number associated with a Facebook account.\n3. Click the Search button.\n4. Follow the prompts for password reset.\n\nExpected Result:\n- User is guided through the password recovery process.\n- User receives either a password reset email or SMS based on their account settings.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 5\n\nTest Case Title: User Remains Logged In After Checking “Keep Me Logged In”\nModule: Login\nPriority: Low\n\nPreconditions:\n- User is on the Facebook login page.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Enter a valid email address or phone number in the Username field.\n2. Enter the correct password in the Password field.\n3. Check the “Keep me logged in” checkbox.\n4. Click the Log In button.\n5. Close the browser without logging out.\n6. Open the browser and navigate again to facebook.com.\n\nExpected Result:\n- User is still logged in and is redirected to the Facebook homepage without re-entering credentials.",
                            "message_type": "replier",
                            "created_at": "2026-07-06 21:12:04",
                            "updated_at": "2026-07-06 21:12:04"
                        }
                    ]
